  "description": "Cross-platform WebRTC for .NET. Browser (Blazor WASM) and desktop from a single API. Data channels, audio, video, media streams, tracks, transceivers, ICE, DTLS, SCTP. Zero-copy JS types in WASM. Serverless signaling via WebTorrent tracker protocol. Powered by SpawnDev.SpawnJS (browser) and SipSorcery (desktop).",
